      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand the warning, but i've already tried the sleep hygiene stuff and it hasn't really worked for me. when i do have that small amount of wine, it honestly feels like it fixes the whole experience. is the breathing thing really such a huge concern for just a small amount? it seems like a lot of people do it without anything happening, so i'm trying to figure out if there's a way to do it that's actually managed and safe rather than just being told 'no'.",
